<title>UK: CCCI sets 50 billion yen 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>CCCI sets 50 billion yen 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE CENTRALE DU CREDIT IMMOBILIER DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    50 BLN YEN    COUPON     3.0 PCT   MATURITY    18.MAR.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    18.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> IBCA	 AA-	 DENOMS (M) 100	 SALE LIMS US/UK/JP/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC   20 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
